# pm2b (2026-10-30, pm2 again: pm2 left the menu because its popup press hit CONTINUE; run with -PopupPresses 0): main menu, profiled. With the user's OK the address-based lease wait is skipped by default
# (lease guard: every 16th lease-covered flush still waits; a stamp there turns lease waits back on). base = the
# old waits (deferstores off); p1 = new default; noguard = no guard samples (APS5_NO_LEASE_GUARD); leasewait =
# 590cafaa9's default (APS5_NO_DEFER_OVER_LEASES).
base-0 60 deferstores off
p1-1 60
noguard-1 60 switch APS5_NO_LEASE_GUARD on
leasewait-1 60 switch APS5_NO_DEFER_OVER_LEASES on
base-1 60 deferstores off
p1-2 60
noguard-2 60 switch APS5_NO_LEASE_GUARD on
leasewait-2 60 switch APS5_NO_DEFER_OVER_LEASES on
base-2 60 deferstores off
